  "meta": {
    "name": "Adaptive optics loop",
    "description": "Closed-loop adaptive optics on an 8.2 m telescope in the H band: turbulence in frozen flow (r0 = 15 cm at 500 nm, wind 10 m/s), a 17 x 17 deformable mirror, a 16 x 16 Shack-Hartmann sensor and an integrator of gain 0.4 at 500 Hz. Run the loop (Study) to see the residual fall and the PSF sharpen.",
